{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48806","headline":"田家作 · 皇甫冉","name":"田家作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卧见高原烧，闲寻空谷泉。\n土膏消腊後，麦陇发春前。\n药验桐君录，心齐庄子篇。\n荒村三数处，衰柳百余年。\n好就山僧去，时过野舍眠。\n汲流宁厌远，卜地本求偏。\n向子谙樵路，陶家置黍田。\n雪峰明晚景，风雁急寒天。\n且复冠名鶡，宁知冕戴蝉。\n问津夫子倦，荷蓧丈人贤。\n顾物皆从尔，求心正傥然。\n稽康嬾慢性，祗自恋风烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}